{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786433320487,"sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_00_q5Bsrian8jhe5IQLREQR9966","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/README.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: \"Deep-research scripts\"\n3: description: \"Code-facing entrypoints for research pivots, state reduction, runtime capability checks and YAML path validation.\"\n4: trigger_phrases:\n5:   - \"deep-research scripts\"\n6:   - \"research script entrypoints\"\n7: ---\n8: \n9: # Deep-research scripts\n10: \n11: ---\n12: \n13: ## 1. OVERVIEW\n14: \n15: `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/` contains the code entrypoints used by the deep-research workflow. The modules cover divergent research pivots, state reduction and sparkline output, runtime capability reporting and YAML-backed script path checks.\n16: \n17: ## 2. CONTENTS\n18: \n19: | File | Responsibility |\n20: |---|---|\n21: | `divergent-research-pivot.ts` | Implements the divergent research pivot entrypoint. |\n22: | `reduce-state-sparkline.test.cjs` | Tests the state-reduction sparkline behavior. |\n23: | `reduce-state.cjs` | Reduces loop state for compact reporting. |\n24: | `runtime-capabilities.cjs` | Reports runtime capabilities used by the research workflow. |\n25: | `verify-yaml-script-paths.sh` | Validates script paths referenced by YAML workflow assets. |\n26: \n27: ## 3. BOUNDARIES\n28: \n29: The folder owns research-specific script entrypoints and their focused test. Workflow routing and loop policy remain in the owning skill documentation.\n30: \n31: ## 4. VALIDATION\n32: \n33: Use the source-specific command documented by the owning deep-research skill. The inventory above is the current navigation surface.\n34: \n35: ## 5. RELATED\n36: \n37: - [`Deep-research skill`](../SKILL.md)\n\n(End of file - total 37 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: \"Deep-research scripts\"\ndescription: \"Code-facing entrypoints for research pivots, state reduction, runtime capability checks and YAML path validation.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"deep-research scripts\"\n  - \"research script entrypoints\"\n---\n\n# Deep-research scripts\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n`.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/` contains the code entrypoints used by the deep-research workflow. The modules cover divergent research pivots, state reduction and sparkline output, runtime capability reporting and YAML-backed script path checks.\n\n## 2. CONTENTS\n\n| File | Responsibility |\n|---|---|","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/README.md","text":"---\ntitle: \"Deep-research scripts\"\ndescription: \"Code-facing entrypoints for research pivots, state reduction, runtime capability checks and YAML path validation.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"deep-research scripts\"\n  - \"research script entrypoints\"\n---\n\n# Deep-research scripts\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n`.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/` contains the code entrypoints used by the deep-research workflow. The modules cover divergent research pivots, state reduction and sparkline output, runtime capability reporting and YAML-backed script path checks.\n\n## 2. CONTENTS\n\n| File | Responsibility |\n|---|---|\n| `divergent-research-pivot.ts` | Implements the divergent research pivot entrypoint. |\n| `reduce-state-sparkline.test.cjs` | Tests the state-reduction sparkline behavior. |\n| `reduce-state.cjs` | Reduces loop state for compact reporting. |\n| `runtime-capabilities.cjs` | Reports runtime capabilities used by the research workflow. |\n| `verify-yaml-script-paths.sh` | Validates script paths referenced by YAML workflow assets. |\n\n## 3. BOUNDARIES\n\nThe folder owns research-specific script entrypoints and their focused test. Workflow routing and loop policy remain in the owning skill documentation.\n\n## 4. VALIDATION\n\nUse the source-specific command documented by the owning deep-research skill. The inventory above is the current navigation surface.\n\n## 5. RELATED\n\n- [`Deep-research skill`](../SKILL.md)","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":37,"totalLines":37,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/README.md","time":{"start":1786433320480,"end":1786433320485}},"id":"prt_fefb934ec001pjYOFYAPAVu54P","sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","messageID":"msg_fefb8cb28001oP8hAfYhG7ZWuN"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786433320802,"sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01_w4926HE8VjEQ66Y3Uxy24441","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-dashboard.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-dashboard.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: Deep Research Dashboard Template\n3: description: Template for the auto-generated dashboard file regenerated after every iteration from JSONL + strategy data. Provides human-readable session overview and recovery surface.\n4: trigger_phrases:\n5:   - \"deep research dashboard\"\n6:   - \"research session overview\"\n7:   - \"research dashboard template\"\n8:   - \"research convergence trend\"\n9:   - \"research dead ends section\"\n10: importance_tier: normal\n11: contextType: general\n12: version: 1.14.0.9\n13: ---\n14: \n15: # Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n16: \n17: Auto-generated from JSONL state log and strategy file. Regenerated after every iteration evaluation. Never manually edited.\n18: \n19: ## 1. OVERVIEW\n20: \n21: ### Purpose\n22: \n23: Provides a compact, human-readable summary of the current research session. Serves three roles:\n24: 1. **Observability** — quick status check during long autonomous runs\n25: 2. **Recovery surface** — second recovery channel alongside JSONL after context compaction\n26: 3. **Lifecycle decision** — in confirm mode, shown before `resume` or `restart`\n27: \n28: ### Usage\n29: \n30: - **Location:** `{artifact_dir}/deep-research-dashboard.md`\n31: - **Generated by:** Orchestrator (step_generate_dashboard in YAML workflow)\n32: - **Data sources:** `deep-research-state.jsonl` + `findings-registry.json` + `deep-research-strategy.md`\n33: - **Protection:** `auto-generated` — overwritten each iteration, never manually edited\n34: \n35: ---\n36: \n37: ## 2. STATUS\n38: - Topic: [from config]\n39: - Started: [from config.createdAt]\n40: - Status: [ITERATING | CONVERGING | STUCK_RECOVERY | COMPLETE]\n41: - Iteration: [N] of [maxIterations]\n42: - Session ID: [from config.lineage.sessionId]\n43: - Parent Session: [from config.lineage.parentSessionId or none]\n44: - Lifecycle Mode: [new | resume | restart]\n45: - Generation: [from config.lineage.generation]\n46: \n47: ---\n48: \n49: ## 3. PROGRESS\n50: \n51: | # | Focus | Track | Ratio | Findings | Status |\n52: |---|-------|-------|-------|----------|--------|\n53: | [per iteration from JSONL] |\n54: \n55: - iterationsCompleted: [from findings registry metrics]\n56: - keyFindings: [from findings registry metrics]\n57: - openQuestions: [from findings registry metrics]\n58: - resolvedQuestions: [from findings registry metrics]\n59: \n60: ---\n61: \n62: ## 4. QUESTIONS\n63: - Answered: [X/Y]\n64: - [x] Q1: [summary] (iteration N)\n65: - [ ] Q2: [remaining]\n66: \n67: ---\n68: \n69: ## 5. TREND\n70: - Last 3 ratios: [0.XX -> 0.XX -> 0.XX] [improving | stable | declining]\n71: - Stuck count: [N]\n72: - Guard violations: [none | list]\n73: - convergenceScore: [from reducer metrics]\n74: - coverageBySources: [from reducer metrics]\n75: \n76: ---\n77: \n78: ## 6. DEAD ENDS\n79: - [approach]: [reason] (iteration N)\n80: \n81: ---\n82: \n83: ## 6A. DIVERGENT PIVOTS\n84: - Completed pivots: [from findings registry]\n85: - Failed pivots: [from findings registry]\n86: - Audited overrides: [from findings registry]\n87: - Saturated directions: [from findings registry]\n88: - Remaining frontier: [from findings registry]\n89: \n90: ---\n91: \n92: ## 7. NEXT FOCUS\n93: [from strategy.md \"Next Focus\" section]\n94: \n95: ---\n96: \n97: ## 8. ACTIVE RISKS\n98: - [guard violations, high stuck count, declining trend, etc.]\n99: - [migration events, reducer warnings, lifecycle conflicts]\n100: \n101: ---\n102: \n103: ## 9. EXAMPLE (POPULATED)\n104: \n105: Reference snippet showing what a rendered dashboard looks like after iteration 5 of a 10-iteration run. Use this as a visual anchor when inspecting a live dashboard.\n106: \n107: ```markdown\n108: # Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n109: \n110: ## 2. STATUS\n111: - Topic: OpenCode plugin loader resilience\n112: - Started: 2026-04-20T09:14:22+02:00\n113: - Status: ITERATING\n114: - Iteration: 5 of 10\n115: - Session ID: dr-20260420-091422\n116: - Parent Session: none\n117: - Lifecycle Mode: new\n118: - Generation: 1\n119: \n120: ## 3. PROGRESS\n121: \n122: | # | Focus                       | Track        | Ratio | Findings | Status     |\n123: |---|-----------------------------|--------------|-------|----------|------------|\n124: | 1 | Entry-point discovery rules | architecture | 0.82  | 4        | converging |\n125: | 2 | ESM vs CommonJS interop     | runtime      | 0.64  | 3        | converging |\n126: | 3 | Plugin-load error surfaces  | observability| 0.47  | 2        | converging |\n127: | 4 | Host/plugin version gating  | lifecycle    | 0.35  | 2        | converging |\n128: | 5 | Cross-runtime parity        | portability  | 0.28  | 1        | converging |\n129: \n130: ## 5. CONVERGENCE TREND\n131: - Last 3 ratios: 0.47 -> 0.35 -> 0.28 (declining)\n132: - Stuck count: 0\n133: - Guard violations: none\n134: - convergenceScore: 0.71\n135: - coverageBySources: 0.83\n136: ```\n\n(End of file - total 136 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard Template\ndescription: Template for the auto-generated dashboard file regenerated after every iteration from JSONL + strategy data. Provides human-readable session overview and recovery surface.\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"deep research dashboard\"\n  - \"research session overview\"\n  - \"research dashboard template\"\n  - \"research convergence trend\"\n  - \"research dead ends section\"\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: general\nversion: 1.14.0.9\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log and strategy file. Regenerated after every iteration evaluation. Never manually edited.\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-dashboard.md","text":"---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard Template\ndescription: Template for the auto-generated dashboard file regenerated after every iteration from JSONL + strategy data. Provides human-readable session overview and recovery surface.\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"deep research dashboard\"\n  - \"research session overview\"\n  - \"research dashboard template\"\n  - \"research convergence trend\"\n  - \"research dead ends section\"\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: general\nversion: 1.14.0.9\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log and strategy file. Regenerated after every iteration evaluation. Never manually edited.\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nProvides a compact, human-readable summary of the current research session. Serves three roles:\n1. **Observability** — quick status check during long autonomous runs\n2. **Recovery surface** — second recovery channel alongside JSONL after context compaction\n3. **Lifecycle decision** — in confirm mode, shown before `resume` or `restart`\n\n### Usage\n\n- **Location:** `{artifact_dir}/deep-research-dashboard.md`\n- **Generated by:** Orchestrator (step_generate_dashboard in YAML workflow)\n- **Data sources:** `deep-research-state.jsonl` + `findings-registry.json` + `deep-research-strategy.md`\n- **Protection:** `auto-generated` — overwritten each iteration, never manually edited\n\n---\n\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: [from config]\n- Started: [from config.createdAt]\n- Status: [ITERATING | CONVERGING | STUCK_RECOVERY | COMPLETE]\n- Iteration: [N] of [maxIterations]\n- Session ID: [from config.lineage.sessionId]\n- Parent Session: [from config.lineage.parentSessionId or none]\n- Lifecycle Mode: [new | resume | restart]\n- Generation: [from config.lineage.generation]\n\n---\n\n## 3. PROGRESS\n\n| # | Focus | Track | Ratio | Findings | Status |\n|---|-------|-------|-------|----------|--------|\n| [per iteration from JSONL] |\n\n- iterationsCompleted: [from findings registry metrics]\n- keyFindings: [from findings registry metrics]\n- openQuestions: [from findings registry metrics]\n- resolvedQuestions: [from findings registry metrics]\n\n---\n\n## 4. QUESTIONS\n- Answered: [X/Y]\n- [x] Q1: [summary] (iteration N)\n- [ ] Q2: [remaining]\n\n---\n\n## 5. TREND\n- Last 3 ratios: [0.XX -> 0.XX -> 0.XX] [improving | stable | declining]\n- Stuck count: [N]\n- Guard violations: [none | list]\n- convergenceScore: [from reducer metrics]\n- coverageBySources: [from reducer metrics]\n\n---\n\n## 6. DEAD ENDS\n- [approach]: [reason] (iteration N)\n\n---\n\n## 6A. DIVERGENT PIVOTS\n- Completed pivots: [from findings registry]\n- Failed pivots: [from findings registry]\n- Audited overrides: [from findings registry]\n- Saturated directions: [from findings registry]\n- Remaining frontier: [from findings registry]\n\n---\n\n## 7. NEXT FOCUS\n[from strategy.md \"Next Focus\" section]\n\n---\n\n## 8. ACTIVE RISKS\n- [guard violations, high stuck count, declining trend, etc.]\n- [migration events, reducer warnings, lifecycle conflicts]\n\n---\n\n## 9. EXAMPLE (POPULATED)\n\nReference snippet showing what a rendered dashboard looks like after iteration 5 of a 10-iteration run. Use this as a visual anchor when inspecting a live dashboard.\n\n```markdown\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: OpenCode plugin loader resilience\n- Started: 2026-04-20T09:14:22+02:00\n- Status: ITERATING\n- Iteration: 5 of 10\n- Session ID: dr-20260420-091422\n- Parent Session: none\n- Lifecycle Mode: new\n- Generation: 1\n\n## 3. PROGRESS\n\n| # | Focus                       | Track        | Ratio | Findings | Status     |\n|---|-----------------------------|--------------|-------|----------|------------|\n| 1 | Entry-point discovery rules | architecture | 0.82  | 4        | converging |\n| 2 | ESM vs CommonJS interop     | runtime      | 0.64  | 3        | converging |\n| 3 | Plugin-load error surfaces  | observability| 0.47  | 2        | converging |\n| 4 | Host/plugin version gating  | lifecycle    | 0.35  | 2        | converging |\n| 5 | Cross-runtime parity        | portability  | 0.28  | 1        | converging |\n\n## 5. CONVERGENCE TREND\n- Last 3 ratios: 0.47 -> 0.35 -> 0.28 (declining)\n- Stuck count: 0\n- Guard violations: none\n- convergenceScore: 0.71\n- coverageBySources: 0.83\n```","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":136,"totalLines":136,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1786433320789,"end":1786433320800}},"id":"prt_fefb9364b0011kNciaTbMcVCR2","sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","messageID":"msg_fefb8cb28001oP8hAfYhG7ZWuN"}}
