{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786433865811,"sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_ET_mfqpKhyKXJpiyADSV3YD9214","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview (deepseek-go lineage)\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log and strategy file. Regenerated after every iteration evaluation.\n\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: Portable CLI communication projection (deepseek-go lineage)\n- Started: 2026-08-11T09:30:00Z\n- Status: ITERATING\n- Iteration: 2 of 7\n- Session ID: fanout-deepseek-go-1786433150940-mdbr01\n- Parent Session: rsr-2026-08-11T07-24-21Z\n- Lifecycle Mode: new\n- Generation: 1\n\n## 3. PROGRESS\n\n| # | Focus | Ratio | Findings | Status |\n|---|-------|-------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | Ground-truth the claudish-to-english reference architecture | 0.95 | 8 | complete |\n| 2 | Safest integration boundary in Claude CLI and Codex CLI | 0.80 | 11 | complete |\n\n- iterationsCompleted: 2\n- keyFindings: 19\n- openQuestions: 6\n- resolvedQuestions: 2\n\n## 4. QUESTIONS\n- Answered: 2/8\n- [x] Q1: Reference architecture captured with file-and-line evidence (iteration 1)\n- [x] Q2: Safest integration boundary: Claude (MessageDisplay/stream-json) + Codex (App Server) (iteration 2)\n- [ ] Q3: Normalized event/message model (remaining)\n- [ ] Q4: Streaming/buffering/ordering/concurrency/cancellation/retry semantics (remaining)\n- [ ] Q5: Protected spans + fidelity validation (remaining)\n- [ ] Q6: Provider-neutral config + privacy routing (remaining)\n- [ ] Q7: Observability + evaluation methods (remaining)\n- [ ] Q8: Downstream phase decomposition (remaining)\n\n## 5. TREND\n- Last 3 ratios: 0.95 -> 0.80\n- Stuck count: 0\n- Guard violations: none\n- convergenceScore: 0\n\n## 6. DEAD ENDS\n- Raw session/message IDs in buffer paths: path traversal risk (iteration 1)\n- Replace-mode fail-open across process death: blank-screen window (iteration 1)\n- Codex hooks as generic renderer: no display-replacement event (iteration 2)\n- thread/inject_items for display: mutates model context (iteration 2)\n- codex exec for arbitrary presentation: plain-text (iteration 2)\n\n## 7. NEXT FOCUS\nPi CLI (extension rendering vs JSON/RPC) + OpenCode CLI (server SSE vs plugin events).\n\n## 8. ACTIVE RISKS\n- Codex hooks `suppressOutput` status remains unverified in primary source (inferred).\n- Primary-source surfaces are dated; re-probe before implementation.\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/042-improved-communication/001-research-strategy/research/lineages/deepseek-go/deep-research-dashboard.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/042-improved-communication/001-research-strategy/research/lineages/deepseek-go/deep-research-dashboard.md","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/042-improved-communication/001-research-strategy/research/lineages/deepseek-go/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1786433865803,"end":1786433865809}},"id":"prt_fefc17c7f0015YRGveies1FLOd","sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","messageID":"msg_fefc14713001pR1ffeDjkaJqqQ"}}
