ation, and future golden-corpus design |\n156:- [x] Dispatch a hosted/local provider and fidelity-evaluation lane.\n213:- [ ] Produce the evaluation corpus design, deterministic gates, blind rubric, and operational metrics.\n233:### Implementation-phase golden corpus\n235:Create a versioned, secret-free corpus from representative assistant communication:\n246:| Protected literals and structure | Zero changed, missing, duplicated, or illegally reordered protected spans; fenced code and required Markdown structure remain intact |\n250:| Human quality | Blind raters score meaning preservation, target plainness, and fluency separately, then choose reference-likeness with an `indistinguishable` option |\n251:| Regression signals | SARI, LENS, and a semantic similarity metric inform investigation but cannot independently prove fidelity |\n===checklist===\n56:- [x] CHK-002 [P0] The combined research architecture, evidence flow, executor configuration, evaluation, and rollback are explicit in `plan.md`.\n84:### Fidelity and failure evaluation\n90:- [x] CHK-024 [P1] Human evaluation separates meaning, reference-style/plainness, fluency, and pairwise indistinguishability with at least three repetitions per provider/model/prompt (`plan.md`).\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd specs/cli-external-orchestration/042-improved-communication/001-research-strategy && grep -n \"SARI\\|LENS\\|protected\\|fidelity\\|corpus\\|rubric\\|indistinguishable\\|three runs\" plan.md | head -40 && echo \"===checklist===\" && grep -n \"fidelity\\|protected\\|corpus\\|rubric\\|evaluation\" checklist.md | head -30","time":{"start":1786434504507,"end":1786434504510}},"id":"prt_fefcb44cc001qWhriB8Trl4QR5","sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","messageID":"msg_fefcb2dc3001nV8NzDhn5lCAs1"}}
