es required: zero changed/missing/duplicated/reordered protected spans',iteration:6},\n{id:'f-iter006-005',label:'Fallback contract: fail to exact original, at most one bounded notice per session',iteration:6},\n{id:'f-iter006-006',label:'Deterministic gates must be automatic machine gates (SC-003)',iteration:6},\n{id:'f-iter006-007',label:'Semantic gates need human adjudication; SARI/LENS regression-only',iteration:6},\n{id:'f-iter006-008',label:'Evaluation corpus: versioned secret-free corpus with 6-CLI event fixtures',iteration:6},\n{id:'f-iter006-009',label:'Blind rubric: meaning, plainness, fluency, indistinguishability; >=3 runs',iteration:6},\n{id:'f-iter006-010',label:'Operational metrics: p50/p95 latency, fallback rate, token use, cost, privacy class',iteration:6},\n{id:'f-iter006-011',label:'Pipeline-owner runtimes make display swap naturally atomic',iteration:6}\n]);\nr.ruledOutDirections=r.ruledOutDirections.concat([\n{approach:'Trust prompt-only preservation',reason:'Reference proves insufficient',evidence:'rewrite.sh:117,168,215-224',iteration:6},\n{approach:'Machine-only semantic proof',reason:'SARI/LENS cannot independently prove fidelity',evidence:'plan.md:254-255',iteration:6}\n]);\nr.metrics.iterationsCompleted=6;\nr.metrics.openQuestions=3;\nr.metrics.resolvedQuestions=5;\nr.metrics.keyFindings=r.keyFindings.length;\nr.metrics.coverageBySources['spec.md']=5;\nr.metrics.coverageBySources['plan.md']=6;\nr.lastUpdated='2026-08-11T09:46:00Z';\nfs.writeFileSync('findings-registry.json',JSON.stringify(r,null,2));\nconsole.log('registry updated: '+r.keyFindings.length+' findings');\n\"","time":{"start":1786434650748,"end":1786434650753}},"id":"prt_fefcd76b9001RKgIwQOKoTBIBj","sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","messageID":"msg_fefcd4507001OINyBHhnmebG0L"}}
