{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786434746710,"sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_00_ET_KsdgrYutuFRfEl9Wjl2c1665","state":{"status":"error","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0138-system-deep-loop-communication-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/042-improved-communication/001-research-strategy/research/lineages/deepseek-go/deep-research-strategy.md","newString":"- [x] Q4: What streaming, buffering, ordering, concurrency, cancellation, and retry semantics must the portable assembler honor?\n- [x] Q7: What observability and evaluation methods objectively measure perceptual 1:1 communication parity?\n- [x] Q8: What downstream phase decomposition and handoff evidence should follow this research phase?","oldString":"- [ ] Q4: What streaming, buffering, ordering, concurrency, cancellation, and retry semantics must the portable assembler honor?\n- [ ] Q7: What observability and evaluation methods objectively measure perceptual 1:1 communication parity?\n- [ ] Q8: What downstream phase decomposition and handoff evidence should follow this research phase?"},"error":"Could not find oldString in the file. It must match exactly, including whitespace, indentation, and line endings.","time":{"start":1786434746681,"end":1786434746709}},"id":"prt_fefcef4cf001VZR0TmVx507a2O","sessionID":"ses_010495b2effeRJw5ynhosNr3HY","messageID":"msg_fefcebfd7001Q6cbx0nirKI5KT"}}
